# Redirects for the static site.
# Read by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (and Netlify) from the deploy root.
# This file is copied from public/ into out/ at build time.
#
# Canonical host is the apex (seniorschoolsnetwork.com); send www -> apex.
# Note: cross-host canonicalization is most robustly done with a zone-level
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule once the domain is on Cloudflare — this file is the
# portable fallback. Flip the direction here if you prefer www as canonical.
https://www.seniorschoolsnetwork.com/*  https://seniorschoolsnetwork.com/:splat  301
